sequenceDiagram
    participant Kit as Test kit
    participant Service as MQTT / Shadow service
    participant Device as Simulator
    Note over Kit,Service: R = $vc/devices/device-1/shadow/name/tutorial
    loop Independent device and app credentials
        Kit->>Service: TLS CONNECT and exact SUBSCRIBE
        Service-->>Kit: CONNACK and SUBACK
        Kit->>Service: PUBLISH R/get (clientToken)
        Service-->>Kit: R/get/accepted or R/get/rejected
        Note over Kit: Accept 404 as missing, fail other rejection or timeout
    end
    opt Explicit --exercise on tutorial Shadow
        Kit->>Device: Start device simulator
        Note over Device,Service: Simulator subscribes and reconciles via GET
        Kit->>Service: App PUBLISH R/update (desired.power=on)
        Service-->>Kit: R/update/accepted
        Service-->>Device: R/update/delta or current desired from GET
        Device->>Service: PUBLISH R/update (reported.power=on)
        Kit->>Service: PUBLISH R/get
        Service-->>Kit: R/get/accepted (converged state)
        Kit->>Device: Stop simulator on completion or failure
    end
